Appendix I – Implementation Roadmap: Phased Rollout from Earth Analog to Lunar Deployment

Phase 1 (2027–2029): Algorithm Refinement and Cultural Consultation

· Complete formalisation of all CDG production rules and release open‑source software (rule engine only, MIT licence).
